<title>CANADA: Numac Energy sets common share buyback.</title>
<headline>Numac Energy sets common share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Numac Energy Inc said on Tuesday it planned to buy back up to 4.8 million, or five percent, of its common shares under a normal course issuer bid.</p>
<p>Numac said purchases would be made from time to time when considered advisable.</p>
<p>The bid was slated to start on December 19 and continue for a year or until terminated at the company's request.</p>
<p>Numac said it believed that the buyback represented an approriate use of its funds because the company's shares represented a discount to their fair value.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
